This page is intended to contain information facilitating talking about Lojban in Lojban. It's likely hopelessly n00bish, as I'm (selylacbes) currently a Lojbanist-in-training, but we'll see how it comes along. It may also contain a few little other bits that I've considered interesting, like a categorized list of "relevant" selma'o/cmavo.

'"What is the word for _x_ in lojban?"' (_x_ is assumed to be English) - .i ma valsi lu _x_ li'u la lojban